& [ImplementedCorrespondence]
  + whole lexical lookup replay against the same catalogue index and SemanticFabric precedes source projection
  + exact unit package id package digest and recognition-certificate identity select one admitted package
  + exact QuoteRecord anchor membership and SourceSnapshot file identity select path text anchor and document digest
  + no projected path is opened and no current filesystem bytes participate in the result
  + one projection per ordered lexical match preserves completeness and any missing proof refuses without clipping
  + per-projection and complete-result domains bind exact content lookup proof budget and snapshot boundary
  + whole replay rejects caller-resealed path text certificate document anchor omission addition or order changes

